      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BEETASTIC NZ (1) made it two wins in succession at this circuit and distance when she got the cash by 2 metres last week. Can take advantage of the ace draw to land the hat trick. ISEEUBABY (2) led from one spot wider than this when runner-up to Beetastic last week. Won twice in a row here prior, beating Beetastic in one of those. Big chance to turn the tables. DELIGHTFUL PEG NZ (10) cops a second row barrier this time but draws to trail the top pick early and her form is hard to knock with two wins and a second in three starts so far this time in. She is unbeaten at this circuit and distance so must be a danger. FAKENIT (6) was held up last start but was racing well prior so is worth another chance while COPY CAT QUEEN (7) is a likely improver second-up.",
